text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4428d121-e48e-11f0-b7a0-15d03c1e6b4c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-682cca6d-e48e-11f0-b7a0-83e65f4ac3d3\">자동취소된사이 그사이 혹시 가압류들어오면 어쩌나~~,걱정이큽니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-51f4025a-e48e-11f0-b7a0-831b7f6b457e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-682cca6e-e48e-11f0-b7a0-4fede0a4bb1c\">2억시세에 담보대출만1억5천 ~~</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5f354187-e48e-11f0-b7a0-6fe8716e930c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-682cca6f-e48e-11f0-b7a0-435259f0f3e3\">가진거라고는 그거밖에없는데요~~ㅠㅠ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-e74d9bc5-e48d-11f0-b7a0-71eb57624b09\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
